In Tobiano, feed is made up of different nutrients found in the real world, like protein, energy, vitamins and minerals. A horse\u2019s nutrient requirements depend on their workload, size, and life stage. You can grow some of your own feed at your farm to be more self-sufficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991700/extras/1c2a75ce1de783ea60266b793bdc2b3d.poster.avif?t=1774029569\" width=504 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991700/extras/1c2a75ce1de783ea60266b793bdc2b3d.webm?t=1774029569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991700/extras/1c2a75ce1de783ea60266b793bdc2b3d.mp4?t=1774029569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horses live out together in paddocks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tobiano has a tack shop where you can buy gear for horse and rider. All tack comes in different colors and styles, so there are endless combinations that can add to your horse\u2019s individuality. Tack is unlocked with gold which can be earned by maintaining your login streak or doing daily quests. Unlocked tack can also be crafted in the workshop. Spare tack can be sold for an extra income or equipped on your horses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991700/extras/e8f5ca5ae631330494b3f2ee45ef57b9.poster.avif?t=1774029569\" width=504 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991700/extras/e8f5ca5ae631330494b3f2ee45ef57b9.webm?t=1774029569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991700/extras/e8f5ca5ae631330494b3f2ee45ef57b9.mp4?t=1774029569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tacking up area in the horse profile lets you save an &quot;outfit&quot; for each individual horse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tobiano is semi-open world with a town center, home stables, and trails to explore. \u00a0You can take your horses out to train, do quests, or complete daily challenges.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991700/extras/93f30c56072df7ab36fa242c8b9955ee.poster.avif?t=1774029569\" width=504 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991700/extras/93f30c56072df7ab36fa242c8b9955ee.webm?t=1774029569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991700/extras/93f30c56072df7ab36fa242c8b9955ee.mp4?t=1774029569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training while out on a trail ride</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Offline version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sold through Steam. <br>Platforms: Mac and Windows. \u00a0<br>Payment: one-off payment, expansions sold separately<br>Cross platform: No<br>Multiplayer: No<br>Time progression: User controlled</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Online version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not available yet. \u00a0<br>Platforms: Mac, Windows, iOS. \u00a0<br>Payment: Subscription, expansions included<br>Cross platform: Yes<br>Multiplayer: In the future<br>Time progression: Real-time</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A number of expansions are planned for the future, including jumping, livery stables, new tack and more, see the website for more details:\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Questions?</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out the Q&amp;A section on the website here:\u00a0</p>","developers":["Ida Meyer"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Animation & Modeling","id":"51"},{"description":"Game Development","id":"60"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991700/c0c5943ab99df938da1c034c0d7baebc0387e6a0/header.jpg?t=1774029569","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel/AMD Metal, or M1<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991700/1220916618/372a02bcf99c28794746d3aa6875f501b5b34aa1/1771226463/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771227737","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991700/1220916618/372a02bcf99c28794746d3aa6875f501b5b34aa1/1771226463/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771227737","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991700/1220916618/372a02bcf99c28794746d3aa6875f501b5b34aa1/1771226463/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771227737","id":257287993,"name":"Tobiano Gameplay Trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.ste